WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:09.742
It was a long ride to Grandma's house.

2
00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:16.208
There was heavy traffic on the road.

3
00:00:16.209 --> 00:00:18.118
Bada: Are we there yet?

4
00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:19.913
Dad: We are almost there.

5
00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:23.126
Hold on just a little longer.

6
00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:25.548
Bada: Mom, I'm thirsty.

7
00:00:25.549 --> 00:00:27.516
I need a drink.

8
00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:30.287
Mom: Hana, can you get him a drink?

9
00:00:30.288 --> 00:00:31.893
It's in the cooler.

10
00:00:31.894 --> 00:00:36.337
Hana: Okay. Here you go, Bada.

11
00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:40.135
Dad: Hey, everyone. Grandma is over there waiting for us.

12
00:00:40.136 --> 00:00:43.367
Bada: Really? Where? Where?

13
00:00:43.368 --> 00:00:45.910
Mom: Look on your right. There!

14
00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:52.355
Hana: Grandma! Grandma!

15
00:00:52.356 --> 00:00:54.246
Bada & Hana: Grandma!

16
00:00:54.247 --> 00:01:00.821
Grandma: Oh my goodness. My babies!

17
00:01:00.822 --> 00:01:02.732
Is that Hada?

18
00:01:02.733 --> 00:01:05.805
Grandma: Oh, he has grown so much.

19
00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:07.208
Let's go in.

20
00:01:07.209 --> 00:01:09.246
Everyone is waiting.

21
00:01:09.247 --> 00:01:13.363
Bada: Already? All right!

22
00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:17.588
We were so happy to see Grandma and our cousins.

23
00:01:17.589 --> 00:01:22.062
What a wonderful time with the family!
